WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.397
It was early in the afternoon.

2
00:00:06.398 --> 00:00:11.425
Kip was just waking up from a nap.

3
00:00:11.426 --> 00:00:19.078
He stretched his arms wide.

4
00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:22.114
Kip looked down at Bird's nest.

5
00:00:22.115 --> 00:00:29.917
Bird was still asleep.

6
00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:33.268
Kip looked up at the sky.

7
00:00:33.269 --> 00:00:35.671
He saw something in the air.

8
00:00:35.672 --> 00:00:41.238
It was a bird flying over the park.

9
00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:43.440
The bird was very big.

10
00:00:43.441 --> 00:00:49.775
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

11
00:00:49.776 --> 00:00:54.808
"Is that another hawk?"

12
00:00:54.809 --> 00:00:57.119
The bird was very loud.

13
00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:00.854
"Honk! Honk! Honk!" it cried.

14
00:01:00.855 --> 00:01:03.757
It was coming closer to the tree.

15
00:01:03.758 --> 00:01:09.785
And it was getting louder.

16
00:01:09.786 --> 00:01:20.116
"Bird!" cried Kip.

17
00:01:20.117 --> 00:01:23.388
"Bird!" cried the big, loud bird.

18
00:01:23.389 --> 00:01:25.549
"Bird?" said Kip.

19
00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:27.337
He was confused.

20
00:01:27.338 --> 00:01:30.471
Just then Bird woke up.

21
00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:33.767
"Goose!" called Bird.

22
00:01:33.768 --> 00:01:36.012
"Goose?" said Kip.

23
00:01:36.013 --> 00:01:38.968
Now Kip was even more confused.

24
00:01:38.969 --> 00:01:43.659
"Bird," said Kip. "Do you know this bird?"

25
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.552
"Yes," said Bird.

26
00:01:47.553 --> 00:01:55.352
"She's my old friend, Goose!"

